                        ],
                        "form": "cockades"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7bd21ec4-a021-3c03-9416-515af73970b0",
                        "entry_id": "f7fd83cc-2c9f-3f78-aa0f-0622bb065729",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A rosette or knot of ribbon worn in a hat, especially as an office or party badge."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e94b29d8-0a83-4830-b0da-e33e03f856ee",
                                "sense_id": "7bd21ec4-a021-3c03-9416-515af73970b0",
                                "text": "[…] and Nature had moreover wrote GENTLEMAN with so fair a hand in every line of his countenance, that even his tarnish’d gold-laced hat and huge cockade of flimsy taffeta became him; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ea4f22c-7895-46e4-9229-b136f1972d78",
                                "sense_id": "7bd21ec4-a021-3c03-9416-515af73970b0",
                                "text": "The escort were two mounted patriots in red caps and tri-coloured cockades, armed with national muskets and sabres, who rode one on either side of him."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8865c60b-03ba-4b24-baa4-b7e71f5c1b45",
                                "sense_id": "7bd21ec4-a021-3c03-9416-515af73970b0",
                                "text": "Through the park railings these glances beheld men and women riding in the Row, […] solitary horsemen looking unsociable, and solitary women followed at a long distance by a groom with a cockade to his hat and a leather belt over his tight-fitting coat."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "286a6bd8-4e25-3b5c-8b87-51e905e7f6b8",
                        "entry_id": "f7fd83cc-2c9f-3f78-aa0f-0622bb065729",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An emblem of concentric circles of different colours, identifying the country to which an aircraft belongs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e13dbad-2b5e-49a1-8122-01df26f6399e",
                                "sense_id": "286a6bd8-4e25-3b5c-8b87-51e905e7f6b8",
                                "text": "On the bank of the river in French territory lies a wrecked plane bearing the cockade of the French service."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
